              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoyo Mutukuvu yaika ng'afaanana oti njiibwa yaamwikaku, ate eiroboozi lyaidha okuva mu igulu lyakoba liti: “Niiwe mutabane wange omugonzi, nkwesiimiramu inho.”",
          "type": "text",
